            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Haynoi 0.3.5</h2>

<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>The microphone now releases about 10 seconds after you finish (was a</li>
</ul>
<p>  minute), so the macOS orange "mic in use" dot doesn't linger.</p>
<p>  Back-to-back dictations are still instant.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sonpiaz/haynoi/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
